}

// THIS ROSTER IS INCOMPLETE BY CONSTRUCTION and must not be read as the census's coverage map. It
// carries the regions a lane surveyed, including ones surveyed and found empty; it does not carry a
// RegionUnsurveyed row for everything nobody has looked at, which is most of the country. Adding
// those rows is worth doing only when the census's geographic scope is decided - an unsurveyed
// roster over an undecided scope is a list whose length is an artefact of where the author stopped
// typing. Carried as an annotation rather than a String row because no fold reads it: per DESIGN
// section 4c an ordinary String declaration whose sole purpose is commentary is misplaced or dead
// data, and // is the explicit quarantine boundary for exactly this.
// EASTERN PENNSYLVANIA, SURVEYED 2026-09-08 AND 2026-09-09. Thirteen facilities across Philadelphia
// and the Lehigh Valley carry a cited density claim and a grain standing, and exactly ONE of the
// thirteen publishes a per-cabinet figure at all - Netrality's 30 kW at 401 North Broad, the only
// one in the region and the only one verified verbatim against the page's own bytes. The other
// twelve publish plant: square footage, raised floor, generator counts, UPS modules, critical IT
// load. That ratio is the region's finding and it is why the row is here rather than in a pull
// request body: a reader who sees twelve DensityUnread rows and no receipt cannot tell a surveyed
// market that publishes nothing from a market nobody has opened.
//
// THE COUNTS DISSOLVED ON MERGE, WHICH IS WHAT THE ROW ITSELF ASKED FOR. This region landed with
// facility_count: 13 and density_read_count: 1 hand-authored, and its own annotation said they
// "dissolve into the derived counts being folded from the facility and claim rows themselves".
// FacilitiesModelled now carries the rows, so that is what happened here: the thirteen facilities
// and thirteen claims below are the region's membership and the counts are folded from them. The
// membership is not inferred - it is the roster this lane's own witness executes, twelve claims in
// w_every_other_pennsylvania_density_establishes_nothing plus the one read density in
// w_philadelphia_has_exactly_one_established_density.
